**Read:** [Extração de Ouro: Princípios, Tecnologia e Meio Ambiente — CETEM](../sources/Extracao-de-Ouro-CETEM.lingua#r_5TP6BXRQ7NWKZQZ94WCBQRR8PN), the complete book and all primary methods used in the selected case; [Non-ferrous Extractive Metallurgy — Ray and Pugazhenthy, NPTEL](../sources/Nonferrous-Extractive-Metallurgy-NPTEL.lingua#r_29G1ZF58Y8EG123MNX3ZRNRE2W), the entire precious-metal and refining sequence; [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), the whole precious-metals chapter and shared residual/utility account; [Metal Recycling: Opportunities, Limits, Infrastructure — UNEP International Resource Panel](../sources/Metal-Recycling-UNEP-IRP.lingua#r_40JXFY43ST442BB8MJEAYJT9N1), the complete complex-product and multimetal recovery context.

Gold, silver, platinum-group and associated metals can appear in mineral phases, concentrated intermediates, anode-derived materials, manufactured products, and residues. The form, association, concentration, and impurity population determine suitable preparation, chemical extraction, refining, and final product evidence.

Reconstruct complete routes rather than equating a familiar dissolution chemistry with the whole process. Pretreatment, reaction/transport, separation, adsorption or phase distribution, recovery, refining, analysis, reagent/gas systems, and residual management remain connected. Low concentrations make representative sampling and inventory especially consequential.

Compare measured selectivity and recovery with the actual product specification, associated-metal fate, and uncertainty. A favorable target assay can conceal contamination, incomplete recovery of a valuable associated element, or a persistent hazardous residual. Practical chemical/thermal work uses its actual appropriate professional facilities and methods.

**Work:** read the whole CETEM gold book and reconstruct one complete primary case, then compare a different precious-metal or secondary-feed case from full technical sources. Independently close target and associated constituents through recovery/refining and residuals. Reproduce a substantial kinetic/separation calculation, test competing interpretations with observations, and defend the alternative on useful product, utility/reagent, maintenance, and continuing residual-work evidence.

**Continue:** [Describe an alloy state through phases, defects, spatial structure, and processing history](../structure/Alloy-states-history-and-structure-property-evidence.lingua#r_6DWZGNBM98KP22AK1XC1H55Q7C).

**Return:** [Metals and metallurgical production — feed, refining, structure, useful products, and recovery](../Metals-and-metallurgical-production.lingua#r_59BDAQXT81552YF5F8TH4KQQH1).
